◇ Test "R-CLN-9: storageReport counts bytes the OS still holds in adopted packs" started.
◇ Test "R-NET-8: a refused or invalid resume discards the partial and restarts from zero in the next attempt" started.
◇ Test "R-CLN-8: reportUnreadable announces, forgets and heals every asset the store quarantined with the blob, and a run downloads them again" started.
◇ Test "R-INT-3: a present asset is never counted, quarantined or failed by a redundant transfer of its content" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-16: maintenance stops at its time budget on ManualTimeSource and resumes verification where it stopped" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-11: with eviction not permitted a run that does not fit evicts nothing" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-15: shutdown in created cancels and joins a group's join, which never opens the store" started.
◇ Test "R-CLN-6: purge ends the active run with failed(cancelled)" started.
◇ Test "R-CAR-5: the retention scope bounds bulk runs and evicts excluded entries first without deleting anything by itself" started.
◇ Test "R-CLN-9: after a relaunch the engine reclaims source copies before its first storageReport, so a fresh source counts the bytes of adopted packs" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-2: 10,000 seeded random operations never leave the transition table and keep every engine invariant" started.
◇ Test "R-CLN-10: source copies a source fails to release after a run are recorded for diagnostics" started.
◇ Test "R-CAR-5: identifier, tag and prefix scopes select the same entries in planning and availability" started.
◇ Test "R-CLN-5: every URL handed out stays readable for at least the grace window" started.
◇ Test "R-NET-3: a download completed while the app was dead is adopted from staging, not re-downloaded" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-11: a plan that cannot fit even after eviction fails with insufficientSpace and leaves index, blobs and staging byte-identical" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-12: transfer progress published to subscribers never exceeds 10 Hz per asset under ManualTimeSource" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-12: a subscriber cancelled while waiting is removed and its pending pull returns nil" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-10: availability counts present, missing, stale and failed without any network request" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-11: a waiter of a job the ledger parks for lack of space gets the bytes it needs and the room above the reserve" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-12: a subscriber stalled across two runs receives the second run's syncStarted before its syncProgress" started.
◇ Test "R-NET-3: an offline launch cancels no live background task" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-12: a subscriber that breaks out of its loop is removed when its stream is released" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-12: a store view read before an apply the engine followed never takes the engine's copy back" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-6: a run does not download an asset the store holds present after the engine dropped its binding ledger" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-12: a stalled subscriber's backlog never exceeds one slot per progress key and subject during a 10,000-asset sync" started.
◇ Test "R-CLN-8: the engine re-downloads an asset reportUnreadable quarantined" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-16: maintenance stops between steps once its deadline passed" started.
◇ Test "R-INT-3: an integrity failure never counts against an asset the store bound to that content while the transfer ran" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-12: a subscriber that joins a run in progress receives the run's syncStarted and then its latest syncProgress" started.
◇ Test "R-NET-3: a live background task is re-attached after relaunch, not duplicated" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-12: a commit announces exactly the ids the store bound, in ascending order (step C3)" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-6: with the default tuning, a run does not download an asset the store holds present after a failed apply dropped the ledger" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-12: the invariant check reports a queued job that waits in no queue" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-12: a lagging subscriber receives a run's syncStarted before that run's syncProgress" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-13: after one network edge a member whose attempts keep failing offline while the path reads satisfied starts twice, then waits for the next edge" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-3: lane queues stay within twice their live entries after a released handle's queued members leave, with nothing queued since" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-3: lane queues put entries back at their places, in place order, whatever the order they come back in" started.
